{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921100/extras/a6eb0b653216e0b5be093df690865305.avif?t=1770657824\" width=768 height=366 /></span><strong>Fate of the Seventh Scholar</strong> puts a unique spin on the bullet heaven genre by mixing satisfying combat and build crafting with exploration and puzzle solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will explore a handcrafted map that is not randomly generated, and as you explore the world you'll face unlockable weapons, puzzles, mysteries and boss fights.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you unravel the story of the scholars, perhaps you can put an end to the corrupted reign of the <strong>Scholar of the Sun</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921100/extras/89d4fa272efb6bb0186b647f37330132.poster.avif?t=1770657824\" width=647 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921100/extras/89d4fa272efb6bb0186b647f37330132.webm?t=1770657824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story: </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scholars, rulers of the seven realms, are amassing their forces. Some still serve their fallen king, and some possess their own agenda. One thing is certain, this realm you find yourself in is in absolute disarray. As you try to fight your way and explore the world, you'll find pieces of lore and meet many characters.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921100/extras/e9dd390b828387e41a31a7207c886e36.poster.avif?t=1770657824\" width=768 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921100/extras/e9dd390b828387e41a31a7207c886e36.webm?t=1770657824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight thousands of enemies, as well as a variety of bosses with an arsenal of unique weapons, each featuring a satisfying upgrade path. Complement your weapons with powerful passives obtained from exploration and fighting mini bosses.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921100/extras/537cba5727e20022fa965b52ff2c39f7.poster.avif?t=1770657824\" width=768 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921100/extras/537cba5727e20022fa965b52ff2c39f7.webm?t=1770657824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlockables: </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock weapons, artifacts, consumables and characters through boss fights, exploration and puzzle solving. Every unlockable makes meaningful impact and allows interesting playstyles. Curiosity and exploration is rewarded with many secret items.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921100/extras/9f2d7256dcaf74efd6f2200906950148.poster.avif?t=1770657824\" width=768 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921100/extras/9f2d7256dcaf74efd6f2200906950148.webm?t=1770657824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progression: </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you learn the lay of the land and unearth the many secrets of this realm, you might stumble upon a way to permanently end the curse that corrupts the minds of the scholars. Fate of the Seventh Scholar features a true ending that will slowly reveal itself.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921100/extras/01cc37aa98c07cfeb44674f71906ac09.poster.avif?t=1770657824\" width=768 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921100/extras/01cc37aa98c07cfeb44674f71906ac09.webm?t=1770657824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Resurrection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921100/b48b0ed9ad8bec83b94d7a6a3a03df74a00fccab.jpg"},{"name":"The Headhunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921100/5a30d54fc402fbbf100cfcc788269781120820eb.jpg"},{"name":"The Broodmother","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921100/dc80c38f458fad3b08a0bb2e968046fc7aa94118.jpg"},{"name":"False Queen of Winter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921100/6ef783ea88aaa9845790b2be80cc9f5849b6eaf1.jpg"},{"name":"The Illusionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921100/a1b4aefac4ba9d1194be682a1b5c3f2438165135.jpg"},{"name":"Warden of the Royal Beast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921100/209e0e4f8a73acb078625b7ef310e23a650f99c2.jpg"},{"name":"Scholar of the Woods","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921100/6e07031bc51023957e5e1c33d202808d349dabda.jpg"},{"name":"Scholar of Sands","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921100/1699a37da02796d7b6565862e4049561bba86962.jpg"},{"name":"Scholar of Frost","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921100/9c0bfe821cc371776e0c3a65d6b8c2ac1e1ab3e9.jpg"},{"name":"Scholar of Fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3921100/ceaecf7d3cc433e977f934e78dcb6529a1ba2174.jpg"}],"total":17},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921100?t=1770657824","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921100?t=1770657824","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921100/03e51e3a19dba91d4d7ba44ad64acfb682fe9c5b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770657824","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921100/03e51e3a19dba91d4d7ba44ad64acfb682fe9c5b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770657824","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4000780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921100/extras/a6eb0b653216e0b5be093df690865305.avif?t=1770657824\" width=768 height=366 /></span><strong>Fate of the Seventh Scholar</strong> puts a unique spin on the bullet heaven genre by mixing satisfying combat and build crafting with exploration and puzzle solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will explore a handcrafted map that is not randomly generated, and as you ex